    "enUS": {
      "description": "Have you seen those nasty tainted shrubberies wandering around this valley?\r\n\r\nThose plants are mean, but some of them are not entirely toxic. Their leaves can have medicinal purposes.\r\n\r\nWould you be so kind as to fetch me some Verdant Leaves? You'll have to do a little pruning, of course.",
